---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const title = 'CV';
const description = 'My personal CV.';
const permalink = `${Astro.site?.href}cv`;
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} permalink={permalink} current="cv">
  <div class="container">
    <header class="cv-header">
      <h1>Aleksandra Glesaaen Ødegård</h1>
      <p class="cv-tagline">Advocate of good academic software</p>
    </header>

    <section class="cv-section">
      <h2>📧 Contact</h2>
      <div class="contact-grid">
        <div class="contact-item">
          <strong>Email:</strong> your.email@example.com
        </div>
        <div class="contact-item">
          <strong>Location:</strong> Norway
        </div>
        <div class="contact-item">
          <strong>LinkedIn:</strong> linkedin.com/in/yourprofile
        </div>
        <div class="contact-item">
          <strong>GitHub:</strong> github.com/yourusername
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cv-section">
      <h2>💼 Work Experience</h2>

      <div class="cv-item">
        <div class="cv-item-header">
          <div class="cv-title-group">
            <h3>Omegapoint Norge</h3>
            <h4>Expert</h4>
          </div>
          <div class="cv-duration">2024-11 - Present</div>
        </div>
        <p>
          At Omegapoint I led multiple internal projects focused on technology
          exploration and process optimization, expanding my expertise in
          frontend development, Azure cloud services, and Kubernetes
          orchestration. I developed an AI-driven search solution for the
          company event system and drove significant process improvements by
          standardizing integration testing practices to align with industry
          standards and restructuring project architectures to follow
          established conventions.
        </p>
        <div class="cv-tags">
          <span class="tag">Azure</span>
          <span class="tag">Kubernetes</span>
          <span class="tag">AI/ML</span>
          <span class="tag">Frontend</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="cv-item">
        <div class="cv-item-header">
          <div class="cv-title-group">
            <h3>SINTEF Digital, Optimization</h3>
            <h4>Researcher</h4>
          </div>
          <div class="cv-duration">2021-05 - 2024-10</div>
        </div>
        <p>
          As a researcher in the optimization group at SINTEF, I have developed
          advanced algorithms and applications to address complex challenges in
          healthcare, the aviation industry, construction, quantum computing,
          and the architecture sector. In addition to my technical development
          work, I held market responsibility for the healthcare sector, where I
          worked closely with stakeholders to understand their specific needs
          and challenges, tailoring technological solutions that drive
          efficiency and innovation within the sector.
        </p>
        <div class="cv-tags">
          <span class="tag">Healthcare</span>
          <span class="tag">Optimization</span>
          <span class="tag">Quantum Computing</span>
          <span class="tag">Research</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="cv-item">
        <div class="cv-item-header">
          <div class="cv-title-group">
            <h3>Share Control AS</h3>
            <h4>Software Developer and Project Leader</h4>
          </div>
          <div class="cv-duration">2018-10 - 2021-05</div>
        </div>
        <p>
          In my role as a software developer and project manager at
          ShareControl, I developed a customized application in Excel VBA to
          manage and monitor lease contracts in compliance with the IFRS 16
          accounting standard. The application was designed to provide clients
          with a straightforward overview and perform the necessary
          calculations as part of their accounting processes, while also being
          transparent and easily auditable to meet documentation and
          traceability requirements. Through this work, I gained significant
          experience in interdisciplinary collaboration and communication
          across fields.
        </p>
        <div class="cv-tags">
          <span class="tag">VBA</span>
          <span class="tag">Project Management</span>
          <span class="tag">IFRS 16</span>
          <span class="tag">Excel</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="cv-item">
        <div class="cv-item-header">
          <div class="cv-title-group">
            <h3>Department of Physics, Swansea University</h3>
            <h4>Postdoctoral Researcher</h4>
          </div>
          <div class="cv-duration">2016-10 - 2018-10</div>
        </div>
        <p>
          As a postdoctoral researcher at the Department of Physics at Swansea
          University, I worked on improving the performance and functionality
          of an existing C-based legacy code for advanced particle physics
          calculations. Through optimization and detailed adjustments,
          including the use of hand-written assembly operations, I achieved an
          impressive performance increase, with a 20x improvement compared to
          the previous code.
        </p>
        <p>
          She also gained valuable experience with unit
          testing of complex, parallelized code, contributing to increased
          reliability and maintainability. Additionally, Aleksandra explored
          applications of machine learning to open new research opportunities
          in hadron spectroscopy.
        </p>
        <div class="cv-tags">
          <span class="tag">C Programming</span>
          <span class="tag">Assembly</span>
          <span class="tag">Machine Learning</span>
          <span class="tag">Physics</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cv-section">
      <h2>🎓 Education</h2>
      <div class="cv-item">
        <div class="cv-item-header">
          <div class="cv-title-group">
            <h3>Johann Wolfgang Goethe-Universitët</h3>
            <h4>PhD in Physics</h4>
          </div>
          <div class="cv-duration">2023.08 - 2026.07</div>
        </div>
        <p>
          As a Ph.D. student in physics, I focused on developing effective
          theories to explore inaccessible regions of the quantum
          chromodynamics (QCD) phase diagram, particularly for cold and
          dense states. I developed advanced mathematical frameworks and
          applied graph-theoretical methods to solve complex equations
          analytically.
        </p>
        <p>
          Through my doctoral work, I gained solid expertise in research
          methodology and the use of high-performance computing (HPC) to
          manage extensive calculations. I participated in several
          international conferences, where I both presented and published
          my research findings.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="cv-item">
        <div class="cv-item-header">
          <div class="cv-title-group">
            <h3>Norwegian University of Science and Technology (NTNU)</h3>
            <h4>Masters in Physics - Graduate of Excellence</h4>
          </div>
          <div class="cv-duration">2023.08 - 2026.07</div>
        </div>
        <p>
          As a master’s student in physics, I worked with effective models
          in high-energy particle physics to study the phase diagram of
          quantum chromodynamics (QCD). I compared various mathematical
          methods to solve complex equations and achieved valuable results.
          For my outstanding efforts, I was awarded the prize for best
          master’s student at the Faculty of Science.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cv-section">
      <h2>🚀 Projects</h2>
      <div class="cv-item">
        <div class="cv-item-header">
          <div class="cv-title-group">
            <h3>Some title</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="cv-duration">20xx</div>
        </div>
        <p>
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cv-section">
      <h2>🌟 Other experience</h2>
      <div class="cv-item">
        <div class="cv-item-header">
          <div class="cv-title-group">
            <h3>Some title</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="cv-duration">20xx</div>
        </div>
        <p>
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cv-section">
      <h2>🏆 Courses & Certifications</h2>
      <div class="cv-item">
        <div class="cv-item-header">
          <div class="cv-title-group">
            <h3>Some title</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="cv-duration">20xx</div>
        </div>
        <p>
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

  <section class="cv-section">
    <h2>🌍 Languages</h2>
    <div class="language-list">
      <div class="language-item">
        <div class="language-name">
          <span>🇳🇴</span>
          Norwegian
        </div>
        <div class="language-level">Native</div>
      </div>
      <div class="language-item">
        <div class="language-name">
          <span>🇬🇧</span>
          English
        </div>
        <div class="language-level">Excellent</div>
      </div>
      <div class="language-item">
        <div class="language-name">
          <span>🇯🇵</span>
          Japanese
        </div>
        <div class="language-level">Basic</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

    <section class="cv-section">
      <h2>📖 Theses</h2>
      <div class="cv-item">
        <div class="cv-item-header">
          <div class="cv-title-group">
            <h3>Some title</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="cv-duration">20xx</div>
        </div>
        <p>
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cv-section">
      <h2>📚 Publications</h2>
    </section>

    <section class="cv-section">
      <h2>🛠️ Skills</h2>
      <div class="skills-grid">
        <div class="skill-category">
          <h4>Programming Languages</h4>
          <div class="skill-tags">
            <span class="skill-tag">C# .NET</span>
            <span class="skill-tag">C and C++</span>
            <span class="skill-tag">Python</span>
            <span class="skill-tag">TypeScript</span>
            <span class="skill-tag">Rust</span>
            <span class="skill-tag">Lua</span>
            <span class="skill-tag">VBA</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="skill-category">
          <h4>Technologies</h4>
          <div class="skill-tags">
            <span class="skill-tag">Azure</span>
            <span class="skill-tag">Kubernetes</span>
            <span class="skill-tag">Machine Learning</span>
            <span class="skill-tag">Optimization</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .cv-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 3em;
    padding-bottom: 2em;
  }

  .cv-tagline {
    font-size: 1.4em;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-style: italic;
    margin-top: 0.5em;
  }

  .cv-section {
    margin-bottom: 3em;
  }

  .cv-section h2 {
    color: var(--primary-color);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--primary-color);
    padding-bottom: 0.5em;
    margin-bottom: 1.5em;
  }

  .contact-grid {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.8em;
    margin-bottom: 2em;
    max-width: 400px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }

  .contact-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1em;
    padding: 0.8em 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(84, 142, 155, 0.2);
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }

  .contact-item:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .contact-item strong {
    color: var(--primary-color);
    font-weight: 600;
    min-width: 80px;
    font-size: 0.95em;
  }

  .contact-item::before {
    content: '';
    width: 4px;
    height: 4px;
    background: var(--primary-color);
    border-radius: 50%;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .cv-item {
    margin-bottom: 2.5em;
    padding: 1.5em;
    border-left: 4px solid var(--primary-color);
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, transparent 0%, rgba(84, 142, 155, 0.05) 100%);
    border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;

    p:last-child {
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }
  }

  .cv-item-header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-start;
    margin-bottom: 1em;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1em;
  }

  .cv-title-group {
    h3 {
      font-size: 1.6em;
      margin-bottom: 0.2em;
      color: var(--primary-color);
    }

    h4 {
      font-style: italic;
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--text-secondary);
    }
  }

  .cv-duration {
    font-family: var(--font-family-sans);
    font-size: 0.9em;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    background: rgba(84, 142, 155, 0.1);
    padding: 0.3em 0.8em;
    border-radius: 20px;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .cv-tags, .skill-tags {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5em;
    margin-top: 1em;
  }

  .tag, .skill-tag {
    background: var(--primary-color);
    color: white;
    padding: 0.3em 0.8em;
    border-radius: 15px;
    font-size: 0.85em;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .language-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5em;
    padding-left: 1.5em;
    border-left: 4px solid var(--primary-color);
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, transparent 0%, rgba(84, 142, 155, 0.05) 100%);
    border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
  }

  .language-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    font-size: 1.2em;
    gap: 1em;
    padding: 0.5em 0;
  }

  .language-name {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5em;
    font-weight: 600;
    min-width: 150px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .language-level {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .skills-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
    gap: 2em;
  }

  .skill-category h4 {
    color: var(--primary-color);
    margin-bottom: 1em;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .cv-item-header {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
    }

    .cv-duration {
      align-self: flex-start;
    }

    .contact-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .skills-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
